","Labas, kaimyne!","c2a8d87bf654",0.91],[0,"Oh, by the way, I have a package for you! The delivery guy left it with me.","O, beje, turiu tau siuntinį! Kurjeris paliko jį pas mane.","cd7dd2cdc309",3.87],[-1,"I'm good, thanks. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O tau?",1],[0,"Aw, anytime!","Oi, visada prašom!","12cd4e12fb49",1.52],[0,"Well, if you ever need a favor, just ask!","Na, jei kada prireiks pagalbos – tiesiog paprašyk!","b0364fdfef1e",2.64],[0,"I can water your plants or take in your packages.","Galiu palaistyti tavo augalus ar priimti siuntinius.","8cf67eb66123",2.61],[-1,"Do you have a drill?","Ar turi gręžtuvą?",1],[0,"Sorry, I don't have a drill. Maybe ask Mr. Patel?","Atsiprašau, gręžtuvo neturiu. Gal paklausk pono Patelio?","9de765fbb5a8",4.05],[0,"Bye! Have a great day!","Iki! Puikios dienos!","892a240ee768",1.67],[0,"Hey, sorry to bother you.","Ei, atsiprašau, kad trukdau.","9b76c3e3ed67",1.81],[0,"The music was pretty loud last night.","Vakar vakare muzika buvo gana garsi.","b2875cf5bdac",2.53],[0,"Could you turn it down a little at night?","Ar galėtum naktimis ją kiek patildyti?","02753e235884",2.19],[0,"The walls are really thin.","Sienos labai plonos.","ba206d8015cd",2.11],[-1,"Could you turn the music down a little?","Ar galėtum truputį patildyti muziką?",1],[0,"Ha! No, I mean your music!","Cha! Ne, aš apie tavo muziką!","f10a7dd65bf3",2.9],[-1,"We had a little party.","Surengėme nedidelį vakarėlį.",1],[0,"Thanks, I really appreciate it!","Ačiū, esu labai dėkinga!","0af2b8b353ed",2.36],[0,"See you!","Iki!","8c54be6f4b77",0.66],[0,"Hey, neighbor! How's it going?","Labas, kaimyne! Kaip sekasi?","5ed18723b86f",2.14],[-1,"Fine, thank you. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O tau?",1],[0,"Good, thank you!","Gerai, ačiū!","f06496e36b78",1.8],[0,"So, what's up?","Tai kas naujo?","4e66ec647364",1.35],[-1,"Could you water my plants while I'm away?","Ar galėtum palaistyti mano augalus, kol būsiu išvykęs?",1],[0,"Of course! When are you leaving?","Žinoma! Kada išvyksti?","58e81a4fdf8f",2.14],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"Sure! What is it?","Žinoma! Kokia paslauga?","ac5e561cb67d",1.34],[-1,"Is there a grocery store nearby?","Ar netoliese yra maisto parduotuvė?",1],[0,"There's a grocery store two blocks away.","Už dviejų kvartalų yra maisto parduotuvė.","3614339be1b5",2.11],[0,"Goodbye! Have a nice day!","Viso gero! Geros dienos!","38069af1a2e8",1.84],[0,"Hi there! Did you just move in?","Labas! Ar tu ką tik įsikraustei?","6bdaa471e3c4",1.85],[-1,"Hi! I'm Tomas.","Labas! Aš – Tomas.",1],[0,"Nice to meet you! I'm Rita.","Malonu susipažinti! Aš – Rita.","f6973bfe129d",1.8],[0,"Welcome to the building!","Sveikas atvykęs į mūsų namą!","da6edced86a9",1.33],[0,"How do you like the building?","Kaip tau patinka mūsų namas?","5982f5ddb6e9",1.29],[-1,"I love it here!","Man čia labai patinka!",1],[0,"I'm so glad!","Labai smagu!","14084f9e58b4",1.18],[0,"So, do you need anything?","Tai gal tau ko nors reikia?","8fbfdaf7d274",1.83],[-1,"Where's the laundry room?","Kur yra skalbykla?",1],[0,"The laundry room is in the basement.","Skalbykla – rūsyje.","53aa99785ece",1.9],[0,"The machines take quarters.","Mašinos veikia su 25 centų monetomis.","0de5ebb797b8",1.58],[0,"What else?","Kas dar?","84ff69983013",1.14],[-1,"Could you take in a package for me on Monday?","Ar galėtum pirmadienį už mane priimti siuntinį?",1],[0,"Of course! I work from home, so I'll be here.","Žinoma! Dirbu iš namų, tad būsiu čia.","fd43ec8f4033",2.66],[0,"Oh, and trash day is Monday!","O, ir šiukšles išveža pirmadieniais!","f4fa8a579846",1.96],[0,"If you need anything, just knock! I'm right next door.","Jei ko prireiks – tiesiog pasibelsk! Gyvenu visai šalia.","a65080cd5e86",2.88],[0,"It was so nice to meet you!","Buvo labai malonu susipažinti!","75c7b5a7e78a",2.17],[0,"Pretty good, thanks!","Visai gerai, ačiū!","303bc0eb0a4d",1.34],[0,"What's up?","Kas naujo?","ae6c59c685ce",0.6],[-1,"Could I borrow your ladder?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti tavo kopėčias?",1],[0,"Sure, no problem!","Žinoma, jokių problemų!","4f0728f403b0",1.51],[0,"Here you go!","Prašom!","4423eaa0f551",0.97],[0,"Hey, would you like to come over for coffee on Sunday?","Ei, gal norėtum sekmadienį užsukti kavos?","5af7d981fe7a",2.85],[-1,"I'd love to!","Mielai!",1],[0,"Great! Is two o'clock okay?","Puiku! Ar tinka antrą valandą?","4c28ca1b001d",1.88],[-1,"How about three?","O gal trečią?",1],[0,"Sure, that works too!","Žinoma, irgi tinka!","29d21313bdb4",1.44],[0,"Perfect! See you on Sunday!","Puiku! Iki sekmadienio!","e850d20a9745",1.51],[0,"Take care!","Laikykis!","0de7eba78871",0.69],[0,"I'm great, thanks for asking!","Puikiai, ačiū, kad klausi!","8ce5f8b2868f",1.81],[-1,"I'm leaving next Friday.","Išvykstu kitą penktadienį.",1],[0,"Sure! Just leave me your key.","Žinoma! Tiesiog palik man savo raktą.","199586ffb405",1.92],[0,"Do you want to come over for coffee on Sunday?","Gal nori sekmadienį užsukti kavos?","a02a15c4f791",1.9],[-1,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[0,"Anytime!","Visada prašom!","ee5a36829b18",0.86],[0,"So, coffee on Sunday?","Tai kaip – kava sekmadienį?","5ca2fdbe3278",1.55],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"See you around!","Iki pasimatymo!","bba68c1c7f09",1.19],[0,"Oh, hi! How are you?","O, labas! Kaip sekasi?","5a7d32e95a48",1.7],[-1,"Where are the mailboxes?","Kur pašto dėžutės?",1],[0,"The mailboxes are in the lobby.","Pašto dėžutės – vestibiulyje.","a11290f3451f",1.53],[0,"Anything else?","Dar ko nors?","00273a80dfcc",0.94],[-1,"On Saturday.","Šeštadienį.",1],[0,"No problem! Just leave me a key.","Jokių problemų! Tiesiog palik man raktą.","002ff8d85e3d",2.18],[0,"Have a great trip!","Geros kelionės!","fac86b2a8292",1.18],[-1,"My name is Tomas.","Mano vardas – Tomas.",1],[0,"Hi! I'm Rita. Nice to meet you!","Labas! Aš – Rita. Malonu susipažinti!","c6cbebc0f36e",2.44],[0,"So, how do you like it so far?","Tai kaip tau čia kol kas patinka?","8a98687e5527",1.91],[-1,"So far, so good!","Kol kas viskas gerai!",1],[0,"That's great!","Puiku!","055603dde86f",1.45],[0,"So, what can I do for you?","Tai kuo galiu padėti?","71f3410bd534",1.7],[-1,"Where does the trash go?","Kur išmesti šiukšles?",1],[0,"Trash and recycling go in the bins behind the building.","Šiukšles ir rūšiuojamas atliekas mesk į konteinerius už namo.","b95bbc50225a",2.82],[0,"They pick up the trash on Mondays.","Šiukšles išveža pirmadieniais.","b1fc0ac788ce",1.94],[0,"Anything else you want to know?","Dar ką nors nori sužinoti?","a1539b0bfcc3",1.34],[-1,"Sorry about the noise last night.","Atsiprašau dėl vakarykščio triukšmo.",1],[0,"Oh, don't worry about it! I didn't even hear it.","O, nesijaudink! Aš net negirdėjau.","cbdc1b3f6bb2",2.17],[-1,"Sorry, I'm busy on Sunday.","Atsiprašau, sekmadienį esu užsiėmęs.",1],[0,"No worries! Maybe another time.","Nieko tokio! Gal kitą kartą.","96db9fe38023",2.18],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[-1,"Where does the recycling go?","Kur mesti rūšiuojamas atliekas?",1],[0,"The blue bins are for recycling: cans, bottles, paper and cardboard.","Mėlyni konteineriai – rūšiavimui: skardinės, buteliai, popierius ir kartonas.","9f55dea9612a",4.39],[0,"Trash day is Monday.","Šiukšles išveža pirmadieniais.","b44ce56a6785",1.34],[-1,"Would you like to come over for coffee sometime?","Gal norėtum kada nors užsukti kavos?",1],[0,"I'd love to! How about Sunday afternoon?","Mielai! Gal sekmadienį po pietų?","ffd209224730",3],[-1,"Sunday works for me!","Sekmadienį man tinka!",1],[0,"Awesome! I'll bake something.","Šaunu! Ką nors iškepsiu.","759d67e3b1f9",2.04],[0,"Oh no, sorry about that!","O ne, atsiprašau!","210bcf3a7acc",1.94],[0,"I didn't realize it was that loud.","Net nepagalvojau, kad taip garsu.","20e9b38a475a",2.13],[0,"I'll turn it down right now.","Tuoj pat patildysiu.","eafc114cbc6c",1.19],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"No problem. Just knock when you're free!","Jokių problemų. Tiesiog pasibelsk, kai būsi laisvas!","1951d5c45910",2.18],[-1,"Could I borrow some milk?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti pieno?",1],[0,"Sure! Hold on a second.","Žinoma! Palauk sekundėlę.","28b424036509",1.58],[-1,"Sure! What time?","Žinoma! Kelintą valandą?",1],[-1,"Thank you very much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[0,"My pleasure!","Mielai!","5021defce9ea",1.18],[-1,"It won't happen again.","Daugiau taip nebus.",1],[0,"Thank you! That means a lot.","Ačiū! Man tai labai svarbu.","da2a760118c8",2.42],[0,"Oh, hi! You must be the new neighbor!","O, labas! Tu turbūt naujasis kaimynas!","24cc278a49c2",2.69],[-1,"When is trash day?","Kurią dieną išveža šiukšles?",1],[-1,"Could I borrow your flashlight?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti tavo žibintuvėlį?",1],[-1,"Maybe another time?","Gal kitą kartą?",1],[-1,"How about Saturday?","O gal šeštadienį?",1],[-1,"Do you have a corkscrew?","Ar turi kamščiatraukį?",1],[-1,"Do you have an umbrella?","Ar turi skėtį?",1],[-1,"Do you have some sugar?","Ar turi cukraus?",1],[-1,"Do you have a vacuum?","Ar turi dulkių siurblį?",1],[-1,"Could I borrow your screwdriver?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti tavo atsuktuvą?",1],[-1,"Do you have a hammer?","Ar turi plaktuką?",1],[-1,"Goodbye!","Viso gero!",1],[-1,"We'll be quieter.","Stengsimės būti tylesni.",1],[0,"Sure, no problem. I'll keep it for you.","Žinoma, jokių problemų. Pasaugosiu jį tau.","14dcce2100e0",2.48],[-1,"Yes, two is fine.","Taip, antrą valandą tinka.",1],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1],[-1,"This weekend.","Šį savaitgalį.",1],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[-1,"A little later, please.","Truputį vėliau, prašau.",1],[0,"No problem!","Nėra už ką!","2d2bc4cb0841",0.81],[0,"That's okay! It happens.","Nieko tokio! Pasitaiko.","9c58ec6e2d99",1.55],[0,"You're welcome!","Prašom!","447e4a28cd6c",0.79],[0,"No worries! It was fine.","Nieko tokio! Viskas buvo gerai.","be81d87dc8dd",2.03],[-1,"Could I borrow your drill?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti tavo gręžtuvą?",1],[-1,"Could I borrow some sugar?","Ar galėčiau pasiskolinti cukraus?",1]],"contexts":[{"sim":7,"vis